
# Playwright diagnostic captures.
#
# These are OUTPUT of a test run, not artifacts: every run re-renders them, so
# 20 committed PNGs churned on every invocation with zero content change --
# dirtying the tree permanently and hiding real edits in `git status`.
#
# Nothing reads them. They are not the product screenshots, which live in
# docs/screenshots/ with a provenance gate over them; these are what an agent
# looks at while debugging a layout, and are worth exactly one run.
e2e-shots/
